  "description": "XEJKAZ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C192 H186 La6 O42 P8. From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 8 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 7 O neighbors; La4 (La) has 7 O neighbors; La5 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La6 (La) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.618-3.840 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.84-100.49°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C192 H186 La6 O42 P8.",
